### Logic Implementation

After creating a Garbage gamestate, I now needed to have players take turns. Therefore, I designed a set of functions which would take the drawn card and attempt to play it, then discard once all possible cards have been played that turn. While the game instantiation functions were difficult to write conceptually, these functions presented the "brain" of the simulation; the code that decides what to do with whatever card the player drew. As a result, these functions were constantly being updated and refined until I was happy with their behavior.

